Adaptation by Chen Gao, 2026:
- Native Typst layout replaces the LaTeX implementation.
- Libertinus Serif and New Computer Modern Math are the default fonts.
- Garamond remains an optional user-selected font pair.
- Modern spelling, standard ligatures, and lining numerals replace the
  historical demonstration treatment; tables use tabular numerals.
- Headings, research-memo metadata, and a height-reserving margin-note block
  are added. The starter uses an optional three-line drop capital from droplet.
  Engraved figures remain outside the scope of this memo template.
- Starter prose and illustrative measurements were written independently.

No upstream demonstration prose, figures, font binaries, MetaPost, or fiziko
code is distributed in this package. fiziko is a separate GPL-3.0 work and is
not a dependency of sepia-memo.

